      "statement": "The interest-scoring sweep is throttled by two config properties, myfeeder.interest.sweep-batch-size (default 50, caps eligible articles enqueued per run) and sweep-delay (default PT2M, run frequency); lowering the former and/or lengthening the latter is the documented response to 429s or circuit-breaker trips.",
